//   E  Entry hall        x -12..12   z -76..-56   the stair up to Mirrormere (south gap), L08 outside
//   T  Teaching room     x -12..12   z -54..-32   a flooded basin; lever 1 drains it
//   H  Ossuary Hall      x -16..16   z -30..-6    knee-deep, four Drowned asleep; branch west, lever room east
//   B  Branch crypt      x -34..-18  z -22..-10   dead end with a chest; a hollow wall hides the closet C
//   C  Secret closet     x -42..-36  z -18..-14
//   L  Lever room        x  18..34   z -24..-8     lever 2 drains the Flooded Crypt and wakes the Drowned
//   F  Flooded Crypt     x -16..16   z  -4..22     deep until lever 2; the twist: the Drowned rise
//   V  Keeper's Vault    x -16..16   z  24..56     B05's arena: fog gate at z 23, Echo Stone inside
//   S  Shortcut          corridor from F's east door (x 18, z 8..12), east to x 36..40, south to z -68..-64,
//                        west to a one-way door in E's east wall (x 13): opens only from the corridor
